  <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><div class="container"><a href="/index.html">Home</a> <span class="sep">/</span> <a href="/tours.html">Tours</a> <span class="sep">/</span> <span>7 Days Kashgar to Bishkek Kyrgyzstan Tour</span></div></nav>

<div class="tour-detail-hero" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg');">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>7 Days Kashgar to Bishkek Kyrgyzstan Tour</h1>
    <div class="route">📍 Kashgar → Taxkorgan → Torugart Pass → Naryn → Bishkek</div>
    <div class="badge-row"><span>🏔️ Overland Adventure</span><span>🌄 Mountain Scenery</span><span>🎓 English Guide</span><span>🐎 Nomad Culture</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="tour-detail-layout">
  <div class="tour-detail-main reveal">
    <h2>Tour Overview</h2>
    <p>This 7-day overland adventure takes you from the ancient Silk Road city of Kashgar into the heart of Kyrgyzstan's breathtaking mountain landscapes. Cross the remote Torugart Pass at 3,752 meters, traverse the vast grasslands of the Tien Shan, visit alpine lakes, and experience authentic Kyrgyz nomad culture. From bustling bazaars to serene mountain yurts, this journey captures the wild spirit of the Silk Road's northern route.</p>

    <div class="highlight-box"><h3>Trip Highlights</h3><ul>
      <li>Cross the legendary Torugart Pass (3,752m) into Kyrgyzstan</li><li>Explore Kashgar's Old City and Sunday Market</li><li>Visit the ancient Tash Rabat Caravanserai</li><li>Stay in a traditional Kyrgyz yurt camp</li><li>Discover Song Kol Lake, a jewel of the Tien Shan</li><li>Experience eagle hunting demonstrations</li><li>Drive through the scenic Kichi-Naryn Gorge</li><li>Explore Bishkek's Soviet-meets-modern capital</li>
    </ul></div>

    <h2>Day-by-Day Itinerary</h2>
    <ul class="itinerary">
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>1</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Arrive in Kashgar</h4><p>Your guide meets you at Kashgar Airport. Transfer to hotel. Evening exploration of the Old City and welcome dinner at a traditional Uyghur restaurant.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Kashgar 4★</span><span>🍽 Dinner</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>2</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Kashgar — Sunday Market &amp; Karakoram Highway</h4><p>Morning at the legendary Sunday Market. Afternoon drive along the Karakoram Highway to Taxkorgan, stopping at Karakul Lake with views of Muztagh Ata.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Taxkorgan 3★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>3</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Taxkorgan → Torugart Pass → Tash Rabat</h4><p>Drive to the Torugart Pass border crossing. After customs formalities, enter Kyrgyzstan. Visit the ancient Tash Rabat Caravanserai, a 15th-century stone shelter for Silk Road travelers. Overnight in a yurt camp.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Tash Rabat Yurt</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>4</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Tash Rabat → Naryn</h4><p>Morning exploration of the Tash Rabat area. Drive to Naryn through spectacular mountain scenery. Visit the Naryn River valley and enjoy a traditional Kyrgyz dinner with a local family.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Naryn Guesthouse</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>5</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Naryn → Song Kol Lake</h4><p>Journey to Song Kol Lake (3,016m), a pristine alpine lake surrounded by summer pastures. Experience nomadic life: milking mares, making kumis, and watching eagle hunting demonstrations. Overnight in a yurt.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Song Kol Yurt</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>6</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Song Kol → Bishkek</h4><p>Watch the sunrise over Song Kol before descending through the Boom Gorge to Bishkek. Afternoon city tour: Ala-Too Square, Osh Bazaar, and the State History Museum. Farewell dinner.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Bishkek 4★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>7</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Depart Bishkek</h4><p>Transfer to Manas International Airport. Your Kyrgyz adventure concludes. Safe travels!</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🍽 B</span></div></div></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What's Included</h2>
    <div class="inc-list">
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>6 nights accommodation (hotels &amp; yurts)</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>English-speaking guide throughout</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>Private 4WD vehicle &amp; driver</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>Meals as indicated (B=Breakfast, L=Lunch, D=Dinner)</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>All entrance fees &amp; listed activities</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>Airport transfers on arrival &amp; departure</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>Border crossing assistance</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>Kyrgyzstan visa support letter</p></div>
    </div>

    <h2>What's Excluded</h2>
    <div class="inc-list">
      <div class="inc-item bad"><span class="icon">✗</span><p>International flights to Kashgar / from Bishkek</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item bad"><span class="icon">✗</span><p>China &amp; Kyrgyzstan visa fees</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item bad"><span class="icon">✗</span><p>Personal expenses &amp; tips</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item bad"><span class="icon">✗</span><p>Single room supplement ($280)</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item bad"><span class="icon">✗</span><p>Sleeping bag rental for yurt stays</p></div>
    </div>

    


